Hello again,

Well: I should have checked more closely before posting. Mea culpa ;-)
But after 10+ hours of work that's not so easy anymore.

In any case: the problem was, as many of you guessed correctly, an
alias of

          du='du -sk'

Though this was rather unexpected for me because I was logged in as root
