As usual barely the time to ask before an answer comes back. In short:
sharing the console is Not A Good Idea and the ISDN port is obsolete.

Dr. Tom Blinn in full:
------- start of forwarded message (RFC 934 encapsulation) -------
Don't try to share the console port with a modem; it won't work.  You have a
very limited system configuration; good luck getting a modem to work.

ISDN support requires a layered product that may no longer be marketed, and
would probably cost more than you want to pay.
------- end -------

Ciao,

Arrigo

