Subject: Summary: odd mkpasswd message & adduser script
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078728412058

Called Dec support on this problem and went through the normally file
checks.

Turned out that two lock files were left behind on the passwd file.

/etc/passwd.new.dir
/etc/passwd.new.pag

These file locks prevented mkpasswd from running and also were the cause of
the error message in the adduser script.

Thanks for many suggested solutions, gave me other things to check as well.

